{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>44歲美國女星安妮希芙威（Anne Hathaway）為美國電影監製丈夫Adam Shulman誕下第3胎，周二（17日）被拍到於美國紐約與BB外出，安妮戴住鴨舌帽與黑超，穿着灰色長身外套，以前向式嬰兒背帶將BB綁在胸前。安妮與同行的友人一邊行，一邊又講又笑，還停下來讓友人用手機拍照，心情大好。安妮與Adam亦育有10歲兒子Jonathan與6歲兒子Jack，他們未有公布第3胎的任何資料。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T08:03:58.076152+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T01:45:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T17:17:48.804551+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:57:17.981922+00:00","content_hash":"02fcf2ef458fbe547e9f2e95eb1fad2262fea1ba4d971d4a716316c180d46565","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}